{"unit_id":"KouzakiUmi__dsh-tool-discovery#card-zh","repo":"KouzakiUmi/dsh-tool-discovery","commit":"cbf8b1bc1f66209a59f14cd06aab4ae7f8dc6cb1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tool Discovery 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的渐进式工具发现插件。它通过三个入口把工具目录、检索与按需加载接入会话：tool_list 分页浏览类别和工具，tool_search 按任务描述返回候选及版本引用，tool_load 记录选择并让工具定义从下一轮开始披露。它还提供当前会话已选、已披露和失效状态视图，并在原生工具路径维护披露定义的稳定性。适合希望减少首轮工具定义、按需查找并启用工具的 DSH 用户；需要兼容的 DSH 宿主，代码没有配置 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/adapters/dsh/entries.mjs:62-108","plugin/domain/engine.mjs:382-428","plugin/domain/engine.mjs:625-630","plugin/adapters/dsh/index.mjs:607-610"]}
{"unit_id":"KouzakiUmi__dsh-tool-discovery#card-en","repo":"KouzakiUmi/dsh-tool-discovery","commit":"cbf8b1bc1f66209a59f14cd06aab4ae7f8dc6cb1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Tool Discovery is a discovery plugin for DSH Web. tool_list browses categories, tool_search finds candidates, and tool_load records selections for next-request disclosure. A state view shows selected and invalidated tools. It helps users load tools as needed and requires a compatible DSH host.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/adapters/dsh/entries.mjs:62-108","plugin/domain/engine.mjs:382-428","plugin/domain/engine.mjs:625-630","plugin/adapters/dsh/index.mjs:607-610"]}
